# prompt: footstep on grass
# tags: footstep, grass, walk, foley
# Grass has no resonator in it at all, which is what separates this from
# `footstep-wood`: there is no modal layer, only a dense field of blades
# letting go at `bend 1` and a brown-noise layer for the soil taking the weight.
sound "footstep grass" 200ms foley
  crunch: noise pink >> bp ~2400Hz[1000..5000] Q1.5 | gain 0.6 attack 3ms decay 90ms
  blades: grains ~3600Hz[1800..7000] rate ~180[80..400] width 3ms spread 2 bend 1 | gain 0.4 decay 120ms
  soil: noise brown >> lp ~500Hz[200..1200] | gain 0.34 decay 80ms
